# spec-gate baseline (plan 0.114): what the Spec still imports or re-exports
# beyond itself. Lines may only be DELETED. `import M`: M is in the full
# import closure of Once.Spec but outside Once.Spec.*. `reexport-impl A B`:
# A re-exports an implementation module. `reexport-wholesale A B`: A
# re-exports B with no `using` list. `spec-public|spec-renaming|spec-hiding M`:
# the Spec module M uses that keyword (the goal is none of the three).
